  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 302.04 Alternatives to Repairing or Reconstructing a Dam.\n\n(a) In lieu of repairing or reconstructing a dam as required pursuant to Env-Wr 302.03, the owner may:\n\n(1) Remove the dam in accordance with chapter Env-Wr 600; or\n\n(2) Modify the dam in accordance with Env-Wr 302.05.\n\n(b) Such removal or modification shall be equivalent to complying with Env-Wr 302.03.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; amd by #4534, eff 11-30-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
